{"4268320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Quixotic", "steam_appid": 4268320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun casual running game where you control a golden capsule rolling forward on a cobblestone track. Your goal is to collect the glowing yellow coins along the way while avoiding obstacles like red blocks. You’ll also need to watch out for scene elements such as benches and scaffolding on both sides to avoid colliding and veering off the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The top left corner of the interface displays your current distance traveled and the number of coins collected in real time. As the distance increases, the obstacles and coins on the track become more densely distributed—this tests your reaction speed and requires you to adjust the capsule’s direction nimbly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a bright, fresh art style and an open tree-lined track setting, the game is easy to play yet full of rhythm. The sense of achievement from collecting coins and the tension of dodging obstacles will keep you hooked.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun casual running game where you control a golden capsule rolling forward on a cobblestone track. Your goal is to collect the glowing yellow coins along the way while avoiding obstacles like red blocks. You’ll also need to watch out for scene elements such as benches and scaffolding on both sides to avoid colliding and veering off the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The top left corner of the interface displays your current distance traveled and the number of coins collected in real time. As the distance increases, the obstacles and coins on the track become more densely distributed—this tests your reaction speed and requires you to adjust the capsule’s direction nimbly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a bright, fresh art style and an open tree-lined track setting, the game is easy to